    "type": "game",
    "name": "Age Of Warbots",
    "steam_appid": 3371630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Campaign</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right units on a constrained budget and place them in strategic positions to defeat the enemy warbots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warbot has its strengths and weaknesses so picking the right ones is key to your victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the battle starts, you can let your warbots do their thing or command them directly, RTS-style. You can even control individual warbots in third-person mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sandbox</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sandbox mode is where you can let your imagination go wild. Build your own maps and simulate any battle you want involving any warbots you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=566 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Warbot Editor</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own custom warbots to be used in the sandbox mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=470 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Campaign</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right units on a constrained budget and place them in strategic positions to defeat the enemy warbots! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warbot has its strengths and weaknesses so picking the right ones is key to your victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the battle starts, you can let your warbots do their thing or command them directly, RTS-style. You can even control individual warbots in third-person mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/b89fcda4e56ec0f025496f9bbaee5f35.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Sandbox</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sandbox mode is where you can let your imagination go wild. Build your own maps and simulate any battle you want involving any warbots you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=566 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/96d8af723d71c88e1daa52a62a5b8971.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Warbot Editor</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own custom warbots to be used in the sandbox mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.poster.avif?t=1753952791\" width=470 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.webm?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371630/extras/ad6b7245fb1fb6aa1f9ba068863e1ce9.mp4?t=1753952791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Age of Warbots is a physics-based sandbox battle simulator involving cool transforming warbots! You can build your own warbots and program their battle AI. Play with a wide variety of ready-made in-game warbots or download warbots created by other players!",
